  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment in global depositary receipts (GDRs) of Air Astana JSC  (the company), a joint-stock company incorporated in Kazakhstan. The investment  was made as part of the Company&apos;s IPO, which took place on 9 February 2024.  The IPO proceeds will finance (i) the company&apos;s fleet expansion and renewal  programme; (ii) construction of a maintenance facility; and (iii) acquisition  of a flight simulator.</narrative>
